# The format check covers the Node project's own files only (T07, #57): JavaScript and
# JSON in scripts/ and tests/, and the root config files. Docs, content, and the sandbox
# kit are not reformatted.
# The vendored Retypeset code (src/, *.config.ts, scripts/*.ts, public/) keeps upstream's own
# formatting (T09, #58): Prettier would rewrite 26 of its 31 TS/JS/CSS files and every
# .astro file, which would bury our changes and make the monthly upstream comparison
# unreadable. ESLint covers src/.
/*
!/scripts/
!/tests/
!/package.json
!/tsconfig.json
!/tsconfig.tools.json
!/*.config.js
!/.prettierrc.json
/scripts/*.ts
**/*.md
**/*.yaml
**/*.yml
# Existing JSON kept byte-for-byte (a fixture and the Codex result schema).
/scripts/codex-result.schema.json
/tests/scripts/main-watch/fixtures/
